  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1177665458825089125/ec_aquaculture_plugin_title.png\" alt=\"擴展戰鬥水產養殖插件標題圖片\" width=\"500\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-aquaculture-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 取得\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152401406247047188/curios_api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"179\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152636014880366763/expanded_combat_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"252\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1177665503511199894/aquaculture_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Aquaculture\" width=\"206\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴展戰鬥 (Expanded Combat)</a> 開發的插件模組，新增與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水產養殖 (Aquaculture)</a> 中涅普頓尼姆材料的相容性。</p><h4>新增以下材料支援：</h4><p>涅普頓尼姆：包含由主模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴展戰鬥 (Expanded Combat)</a> 新增的箭袋、武器、護手與盾牌。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>重要事項：</strong></h5><p><strong>如需回報錯誤，請使用 GitHub 的問題追蹤系統 <a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></p><p><strong>若因其他原因需要聊天/討論，請使用 Discord <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>點選橫幅以獲得優惠：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d94f7046-2c94-404e-a3dc-3a798daef810.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
